```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Politique de confidentialité - Proverbes Pulaar</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
            color: #333;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 40px auto;
